			<title>Terms of Service</title>
			<link></link>
			<pubDate></pubDate>
			<dc:creator><![CDATA[eherrera]]></dc:creator>
			<guid isPermaLink="false"><![CDATA[eherrera]]></guid>
			<description></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<b>Effective Date:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 07/01/2026</span>

GC Reliable Service is a brand operated by ROC Comfort HVAC LLC ("we," "us," or "our").

<span style="font-weight: 400;">GC Reliable Services (“Company,” “we,” “us,” or “our”), you agree to comply with these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please refrain from using our services.</span>

<b>Brand Name</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span>ROC Comfort HVAC LLC

<b>Types of Messages You May Receive</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">By providing your contact information and opting into communications from us, you agree to receive the following types of messages:</span>
<ul>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Appointment reminders</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Service updates</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Promotional and marketing messages</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Informational and customer support messages</span></li>
</ul>
<b>Message Frequency Disclosure</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">The frequency of messages you receive may vary depending on service needs, appointment schedules, and promotional campaigns. For appointment-related communications, you may receive up to two messages per appointment.</span>

<b>Opt-In for SMS Notifications</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">By providing your phone number and opting in to receive text messages, you consent to receive SMS notifications from ROC Comfort HVAC LLC, including appointment reminders, service updates, and promotional communications. Consent to receive these messages is not a condition of purchase. You may opt in either in person or during a phone call initiated by you.</span>

<span style="font-weight: 400;">Upon first registration, you will be asked for your phone number and notified about the possibility of receiving text messages, including the following:</span>
<ul>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Message and data rates may apply</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Message frequency may vary</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Instructions on how to unsubscribe by replying “STOP” or requesting help by replying “HELP”</span></li>
 	<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Your contact information will not be shared with third parties for marketing or promotional purposes</span></li>
</ul>
<b>Message and Data Rates Disclosure</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Standard message and data rates may apply when receiving text messages from us. Please check with your mobile carrier for details regarding any applicable charges.</span>

<b>Opt-Out Instructions</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">You may opt out of receiving all SMS communications at any time by replying “STOP” to any message you receive from us. If you need assistance, reply “HELP” or contact us at service@gcreliable.com</span>

<b>Customer Care Contact Information</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">For any questions or concerns regarding our messages, services, or this policy, please contact us at service@gcreliable.com</span>

<b>Privacy and Data Security</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">We are committed to protecting your privacy. Your contact information will only be used for the purposes described above and will not be sold or shared with third parties for marketing purposes. For additional details, please review our </span><b>Privacy Policy</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span>

<b>Changes to These Terms and Conditions</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">We reserve the right to update these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be posted on our website, with the effective date updated accordingly.</span>

<b>Carrier Disclaimer:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Message delivery is subject to effective transmission from your mobile service provider and network availability. ROC Comfort HVAC LLC is not responsible for any message failures, delays, or errors caused by mobile carriers or third-party service providers.</span>

<b>Age Requirement:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">By using this website and opting in to receive SMS communications from ROC Comfort HVAC LLC, you confirm that you are at least </span><b>18 years of age</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">. Our services and communications are not intended for individuals under the age of 18.</span>

<b>Acceptance of Terms</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">
</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">By using our services, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms and Conditions</span>

&nbsp;]]></content:encoded>
